# The build context is this producer's own directory and NOTHING is copied out
# of it directly. Its control template and its own copyright come over as the
# `boarddeb` context -- this same directory, named -- so that producer.env and
# the PREPARE hook render.sh, which only the host reads, cannot invalidate
# this producer's cache when they are edited.
#
# The shared boot/common/copyright is deliberately not used here,
# since this payload carries vendor firmware and GPL-2.0 kernel modules that
# it has to record on their own terms.
*
